 `.claude/settings.json` ÔåÆ `permissions.allow`** ÔÇö there is no human to approve a prompt. If your
 project's **gate commands** (test / build / lint / e2e) are not allowlisted, the agent can't run Phase 3
 of `PROMPT.md` and burns iterations editing blind. `/harness-init` appends them; the loop also prints a
-reminder at startup. Confirm they're present **before** you schedule a night. (If your gate is empty ÔÇö as
-in this harness's own root component ÔÇö the deterministic safety net is just rollback + the periodic
