+self-tests before accepting an iteration. The [cross-platform dispatcher](../harness/tests/gate.mjs)
+runs the native twin (PowerShell on Windows, Bash on POSIX), plus the Bash twin on Windows when Git
+Bash is available. An ungraded twin is reported; `HARNESS_GATE_STRICT=1` makes that gap fail the gate.
